# Requirement alignment (before IMPLEMENT)

When the user asks to **implement** a spec or tickets:

1. Run **`align-requirements`** (`.agents/skills/align-requirements/SKILL.md`).
2. Post **at most three** questions; wait for answers or **`skip align`**.
3. Record outcomes under **`## Decisions`** before production changes (any path — not webapp-only).
